{"seq":3,"slug":"reductions-scans","title":"归约与扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/parallelism/reductions-scans","wordCount":1563,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"归约与扫描\">归约与扫描</h1><p>并行算出一万亿个部分结果之后，你几乎总要把它们合成一个东西：求和、求最大、求逻辑与，或者算一条前缀和。这一步看似简单，并行下却是雷区——多个任务往同一个累加器写就是数据竞争。Chapel 把这件事提炼成两个一等操作：<code>reduce</code> 把一个集合<strong>折叠成一个值</strong>，<code>scan</code> 把它<strong>变成等长的前缀结果序列</strong>。这一篇讲清它们的语义、内置算子、与 <code>forall</code> 的结合，以及怎么自定义归约。它是把前两篇的并行结果落地成可用数值的最后一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把并行产生的大量部分结果安全合并，是 Chapel 用两个一等操作解决的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>reduce</code>：折叠成一个值</strong>。用满足结合律的算子把集合并行合并成标量，归约树把关键路径从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；分布式数组下先各 locale 本地归约、再跨节点合并，通信量仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个标量。</li>\n<li><strong><code>scan</code>：变成等长前缀序列</strong>。输出第 <code>i</code> 个元素是前 <code>i</code> 个元素的归约结果（前缀和家族），并行实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 深度，是排序、流压缩、稀疏结构的隐藏主力。</li>\n<li><strong>reduce intent</strong>：<code>forall ... with (+ reduce X)</code> 给每个任务私有累加器、循环结束时自动合并，是并行直方图/计数的声明式标准写法，比手写 <code>atomic</code> 快（无原子争用）。</li>\n<li><strong>可扩展的归约</strong>：内置算子覆盖 <code>+</code>/<code>*</code>/<code>min</code>/<code>max</code>/逻辑位运算与 <code>minloc</code>/<code>maxloc</code>，超出时继承 <code>ReduceScanOp</code> 自定义，只要 <code>combine</code> 满足结合律就自动并行化、跨节点化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"reduce-把集合折叠成一个值\">reduce：把集合折叠成一个值</h2><p><code>reduce</code> 的形式是 <code>算子 reduce 集合</code>，它用一个<strong>结合</strong>的二元算子把所有元素并行地合并成一个标量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"const total = + reduce A;          // 求和&#10;const biggest = max reduce A;       // 最大值&#10;const allPos = &amp;&amp; reduce (A &gt; 0);   // 是否全为正(对布尔数组逻辑与)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const total = + reduce A;          // 求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const biggest = max reduce A;       // 最大值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const allPos = &#x26;&#x26; reduce (A > 0);   // 是否全为正(对布尔数组逻辑与)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>它为什么能并行？因为合并算子满足结合律：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">((a_1 \\oplus a_2) \\oplus a_3) = (a_1 \\oplus (a_2 \\oplus a_3))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。于是运行时可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素分成若干块，各任务先归约自己那块得部分结果，再把部分结果两两合并，形成一棵归约树。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个元素的归约，关键路径长度从串行的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 为任务数）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext>reduce </mtext><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>⨁</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>深度</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+ \\text{reduce } A = \\bigoplus_{i=1}^{n} A_i, \\qquad \\text{深度} = O(\\log p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reduce </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⨁</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">深度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A0[A 1..2: 部分和] --&gt; S0[子和 01]&#10;  A1[A 3..4: 部分和] --&gt; S0&#10;  A2[A 5..6: 部分和] --&gt; S1[子和 23]&#10;  A3[A 7..8: 部分和] --&gt; S1&#10;  S0 --&gt; T[总和]&#10;  S1 --&gt; T\">graph TD\n  A0[A 1..2: 部分和] --&gt; S0[子和 01]\n  A1[A 3..4: 部分和] --&gt; S0\n  A2[A 5..6: 部分和] --&gt; S1[子和 23]\n  A3[A 7..8: 部分和] --&gt; S1\n  S0 --&gt; T[总和]\n  S1 --&gt; T</pre><p>对<strong>分布式数组</strong>，这棵树是分层的：先在各 locale 内归约本地数据（无通信），再把每个 locale 的一个部分结果跨节点合并（通信量仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个标量，而非整个数组）。这就是为什么 <code>+ reduce A</code> 在上千节点上依然高效——它把海量数据的归约压成了极少量的跨节点通信，呼应<a href=\"../foundations/global-view-pgas\">全局视图与 PGAS</a>讲的「最大化本地、最小化远程」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内置归约算子\">内置归约算子</h2><p>Chapel 内置了一组常用算子，覆盖绝大多数需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>单位元</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>+</code></td>\n<td>求和</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>总量、点积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>*</code></td>\n<td>求积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>阶乘、概率连乘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min</code> / <code>max</code></td>\n<td>极值</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>边界、范数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;&amp;</code> / <code>||</code></td>\n<td>逻辑与/或</td>\n<td><code>true</code> / <code>false</code></td>\n<td>全满足/存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&amp;</code> / <code>|</code> / <code>^</code></td>\n<td>位与/或/异或</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>位掩码合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minloc</code> / <code>maxloc</code></td>\n<td>极值<strong>及其下标</strong></td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>找最大值在哪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>minloc</code>／<code>maxloc</code> 特别有用——它同时返回极值和位置，配 zippered 迭代用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"const (peak, idx) = maxloc reduce zip(A, A.domain);&#10;writeln(&quot;最大值 &quot;, peak, &quot; 出现在下标 &quot;, idx);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const (peak, idx) = maxloc reduce zip(A, A.domain);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>writeln(\"最大值 \", peak, \" 出现在下标 \", idx);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"reduce-intent-在-forall-里就地归约\">reduce intent：在 forall 里就地归约</h2><p>把归约和 <code>forall</code> 结合有两种写法。一是 <code>reduce</code> 直接作用于 <code>forall</code> 表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"const sumSq = + reduce forall x in data do x ** 2;   // 并行求平方和\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const sumSq = + reduce forall x in data do x ** 2;   // 并行求平方和</span></span></code></pre></div><p>二是当循环体复杂、需要在过程中累积时，用 <strong>reduce intent</strong>（呼应<a href=\"data-parallelism\">数据并行 forall</a>的 forall intent 体系）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"var hist: [0..#nbins] int;&#10;forall x in data with (+ reduce hist) {     // 每任务私有一份 hist, 末尾按 + 合并&#10;  const b = bin(x);&#10;  hist[b] += 1;                              // 写的是任务私有副本, 无竞争&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>var hist: [0..#nbins] int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>forall x in data with (+ reduce hist) {     // 每任务私有一份 hist, 末尾按 + 合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const b = bin(x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hist[b] += 1;                              // 写的是任务私有副本, 无竞争</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>reduce intent 的精妙在于：每个任务拿到一份<strong>私有</strong>的累加器（数组也行），循环里随便写、零竞争，循环结束时运行时按指定算子把所有私有副本合并成最终结果。它把「私有累积 + 末尾合并」这个高性能惯用法（<a href=\"task-parallelism\">任务并行</a>里手写过的那个）变成了声明式的一行——这是 Chapel 表达并行直方图、并行计数等模式的标准做法，比手写 <code>atomic</code> 快得多（无原子争用）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"scan-保留中间结果的前缀运算\">scan：保留中间结果的前缀运算</h2><p><code>scan</code> 和 <code>reduce</code> 用同样的算子，但输出不是一个值，而是一个<strong>等长数组</strong>，第 <code>i</code> 个元素是前 <code>i</code> 个元素的归约结果——即前缀和（prefix sum）家族：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"const A = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5];&#10;writeln(+ scan A);   // [3, 4, 8, 9, 14]  (累积前缀和, inclusive)&#10;writeln(max scan A); // [3, 3, 4, 4, 5]   (前缀最大值)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const A = [3, 1, 4, 1, 5];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>writeln(+ scan A);   // [3, 4, 8, 9, 14]  (累积前缀和, inclusive)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>writeln(max scan A); // [3, 3, 4, 4, 5]   (前缀最大值)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>前缀和看似天生串行（第 <code>i</code> 个依赖第 <code>i-1</code> 个），但有著名的并行算法（Blelloch 扫描）能在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 深度内完成，Chapel 的 <code>scan</code> 就是并行实现的。它是许多并行算法的隐藏主力：流压缩（stream compaction）、基数排序的桶偏移、稀疏矩阵的行指针计算，底层都是 scan。Arkouda 的高性能 argsort（<a href=\"../practice/chapel-performance\">性能与扩展性</a>会细讲）正大量依赖分布式 scan 来计算各桶在全局数组中的偏移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自定义归约-超越内置算子\">自定义归约：超越内置算子</h2><p>当内置算子不够——比如你要同时求和、求平方和、求计数来一趟算出均值与方差——可以定义自己的归约类，继承 <code>ReduceScanOp</code> 并实现几个钩子方法：<code>accumulate</code>（把一个元素并入私有累加器）、<code>combine</code>（合并两个私有累加器）、<code>generate</code>（产出最终值）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"class MeanVarReducer: ReduceScanOp {&#10;  type eltType;&#10;  var count: int;&#10;  var sum, sumSq: real;&#10;  proc accumulate(x) { count += 1; sum += x; sumSq += x*x; }&#10;  proc combine(other) { count += other.count; sum += other.sum; sumSq += other.sumSq; }&#10;  proc generate() { const m = sum/count; return (m, sumSq/count - m*m); }&#10;  // ... clone / identity 等钩子省略&#10;}&#10;const (mean, variance) = MeanVarReducer reduce data;   // 一趟算出均值和方差\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MeanVarReducer: ReduceScanOp {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type eltType;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var count: int;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var sum, sumSq: real;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc accumulate(x) { count += 1; sum += x; sumSq += x*x; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc combine(other) { count += other.count; sum += other.sum; sumSq += other.sumSq; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc generate() { const m = sum/count; return (m, sumSq/count - m*m); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // ... clone / identity 等钩子省略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const (mean, variance) = MeanVarReducer reduce data;   // 一趟算出均值和方差</span></span></code></pre></div><p>只要你的 <code>combine</code> 满足结合律，Chapel 就能把它并行化、跨节点化，无需你写一行通信。自定义归约把 <code>reduce</code> 从「一组固定算子」升级为「任意可结合折叠」的通用框架——这是 Chapel 数据并行表达力的天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>reduce</code> 用结合算子把集合并行折叠成一个标量，归约树把关键路径从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；分布式数组下先本地归约再跨节点合并，通信仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个标量。</li>\n<li>内置算子覆盖 <code>+</code>、<code>*</code>、<code>min</code>/<code>max</code>、逻辑与位运算，以及返回「值 + 下标」的 <code>minloc</code>/<code>maxloc</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>reduce intent</strong>（<code>forall ... with (+ reduce X)</code>）给每任务私有累加器、末尾自动合并，是并行直方图/计数的声明式标准写法，比手写 atomic 快。</li>\n<li><code>scan</code> 输出等长的前缀结果序列（前缀和家族），并行实现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 深度，是排序、流压缩、稀疏结构的隐藏主力。</li>\n<li>自定义归约（继承 <code>ReduceScanOp</code>、实现 <code>accumulate</code>/<code>combine</code>/<code>generate</code>）把折叠推广到任意可结合算子，且自动并行化、跨节点化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：归约的私有累积思路源自<a href=\"data-parallelism\">数据并行 forall</a>的 intent 体系，手写版见<a href=\"task-parallelism\">任务并行 begin/cobegin</a>；分布式归约高效的根因在<a href=\"../foundations/global-view-pgas\">全局视图与 PGAS</a>；scan 在真实负载中的威力见<a href=\"../practice/chapel-performance\">性能与扩展性</a>。横向对照 Julia 的并行归约见 <a href=\"../../julia-scientific/applications/parallel-distributed\">Julia：并行与分布式</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://chapel-lang.org/docs/\">Chapel Documentation 2.8 — Reductions and Scans</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.10333\">Improving a High Productivity Data Analytics Chapel Framework (arXiv:2111.10333)</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"归约与扫描","id":"归约与扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"reduce：把集合折叠成一个值","id":"reduce-把集合折叠成一个值"},{"level":2,"text":"内置归约算子","id":"内置归约算子"},{"level":2,"text":"reduce intent：在 forall 里就地归约","id":"reduce-intent-在-forall-里就地归约"},{"level":2,"text":"scan：保留中间结果的前缀运算","id":"scan-保留中间结果的前缀运算"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义归约：超越内置算子","id":"自定义归约-超越内置算子"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"任务并行 begin/cobegin","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/parallelism/task-parallelism"},"next":{"title":"域与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/domains-arrays"}}